     6007                 accumulate f-cost-sum       (TOTAL  by goods.grp-name ) .
     6008                 accumulate f-sale-sum       (TOTAL  by goods.grp-name ) .
     6009                 accumulate f-sale-other     (TOTAL  by goods.grp-name ) .
