     6019                 accumulate f-sale-sum       (TOTAL  by ub.gds-season.sea-code ) .
     6020                 accumulate f-sale-other     (TOTAL  by ub.gds-season.sea-code ) .
     6021                 accumulate f-crsa-sum       (TOTAL  by ub.gds-season.sea-code ) .
     6022                 accumulate f-qnty-all       (TOTAL  by ub.gds-season.sea-code ) .
     6023                 accumulate f-cost-sum-all   (TOTAL  by ub.gds-season.sea-code ) .
